+<script>self.__next_f.push([1,"20:I[344889,[\"$7\",\"$8\"],\"div\"]\n21:I[344889,[\"$7\",\"$8\"],\"article\"]\n22:T7d0,\u003ch3\u003eOverview\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePurdue Global Law School (formerly Concord Law School) is the nation’s first fully online law school. The project was a complete redesign of its digital platform, with the goal of modernizing the site, reinforcing the school’s credibility, and making the experience clearer for prospective students — many of whom are working professionals balancing education with full-time careers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eRole\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFront End Developer\u003cbr\u003e\nAngular, TypeScript, LESS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eThe Problem\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe previous site looked outdated and didn’t communicate the professionalism or legitimacy of an accredited online law program. Prospective students needed straightforward pathways to program information, admissions requirements, and outcomes. The challenge was to build a modern, responsive site that presented this content with clarity and authority.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eMy Contribution\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI was part of the front end development team responsible for implementing the redesigned site in Angular. I built reusable, component-based templates that supported program pages, admissions content, and student resources, ensuring a consistent structure across the site.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUsing TypeScript within Angular, I developed strongly typed components and logic that improved maintainability and reliability. For styling, I implemented a modular LESS structure that allowed for scalable, brand-consistent design across templates.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI worked closely with designers to translate complex page designs into pixel-perfect, responsive layouts that preserved fidelity while meeting accessibility and performance goals.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eImpact\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe redesigned site positioned Purdue Global Law School as a credible, professional leader in online legal education. Clear navigation and structured program information made it easier for prospective students to evaluate offerings, while the modernized front end strengthened the school’s overall digital presence and ability to serve working professionals.\u003c/p\u003e\n1c:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"h-60 bg-neutral-100 md:h-96\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto flex h-full max-w-3xl flex-col justify-center\",\"animate\":{\"opacity\":[0,1],\"y\":[50,0]},\"transition\":{\"duration\":0.5},\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"text-4xl/10\",\"children\":\"Purdue Global Law School\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Transforming How Law Is Learned Online\"}]}]]}]}]}],[\"$\",\"$L21\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-15 -0ij1G_rich-text\",\"animate\":{\"opacity\":[0,1]},\"transition\":{\"duration\":0.5},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$22\"}}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$La\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.purduegloballawschool.edu/\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"transition duration-300 ease-in-out hover:text-black/50\",\"children\":\"Visit the site →\"}]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script>
